                <head>Appendix “C”</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Draft Resolution in Regard to
                        Reparation</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">For Presentation to the Peace Conference</p>
                <p>That a Commission be appointed with three representatives apiece from each of the
                    five Great Powers and two representatives apiece from Belgium, Greece, Roumania
                    and Serbia, to examine and report on the question of the amount of the sum for
                    reparation which the enemy countries should pay, and are capable of paying, as
                    well as the form in which payment should be made.</p>
            </div>
